Verify the authenticity of an archived evidence pack. Reads the pack file and its signature (default <file>.sig) and asks the server to recompute the HMAC with its DEK\-derived signing key \(em proving the pack was produced by this deployment and has not been modified. Requires server\-side encryption (the signing key is DEK\-derived).
