Summarize every project's outstanding cleanup signals in one call: secrets whose owner departed, secrets unused for a long window, secrets expiring/expired, stale machine identities, and secrets overdue for rotation. Shows install\-wide totals plus a per\-project breakdown of the projects that carry debt. Requires global system.read. Counts only \(em never secret names or values.
.PP
