.TP
\fB\-\-expiring\-days\fR \fIint\fR
Expiring\-secret window in days (default server\-side: 30)
.TP
\fB\-\-stale\-days\fR \fIint\fR
Stale\-machine\-identity window in days (default server\-side: 90)
.TP
\fB\-\-unused\-days\fR \fIint\fR
Unused\-secret window in days (default server\-side: 90)
