Usage: \fBkeyorix project env create [flags]\fR
.PP
Examples:
.PP
.nf
keyorix project env create \-\-name qa \-\-project payments
.fi
.PP
Flags:
.TP
\fB\-\-name\fR \fIstring\fR
Environment name (required)
.TP
\fB\-\-project\fR \fIstring\fR
Override the active project
.SS keyorix project env delete
Delete an environment by ID
.PP
Usage: \fBkeyorix project env delete <env\-id> [flags]\fR
.PP
Examples:
