.PP
Flags:
.TP
\fB\-\-group\fR \fIstring\fR
Group name or numeric ID (required)
.TP
\fB\-o\fR, \fB\-\-output\fR \fIstring\fR
Output format: table, json or yaml (default table)
.SS keyorix rbac list\-permissions
List all permissions for a user
.PP
List all permissions assigned to a user through their roles
.PP
Usage: \fBkeyorix rbac list\-permissions [flags]\fR
.PP
Examples:
.PP
.nf
keyorix rbac list\-permissions \-\-user alice@example.com
.fi
.PP
Flags:
.TP
\fB\-o\fR, \fB\-\-output\fR \fIstring\fR
Output format: table, json or yaml (default table)
.TP
\fB\-\-user\fR \fIstring\fR
User email address (required)
.SS keyorix rbac list\-roles
List all available roles
.PP
List all roles in the system
.PP
Usage: \fBkeyorix rbac list\-roles [flags]\fR
.PP
Examples:
.PP
.nf
keyorix rbac list\-roles
.fi
.PP
Flags:
.TP
\fB\-o\fR, \fB\-\-output\fR \fIstring\fR
Output format: table, json or yaml (default table)
.SS keyorix rbac list\-user\-roles
List roles assigned to a user
.PP
List all roles assigned to a specific user by email address
.PP
Usage: \fBkeyorix rbac list\-user\-roles [flags]\fR
.PP
Examples:
.PP
.nf
keyorix rbac list\-user\-roles \-\-user alice@example.com
.fi
.PP
Flags:
.TP
\fB\-o\fR, \fB\-\-output\fR \fIstring\fR
Output format: table, json or yaml (default table)
.TP
\fB\-\-user\fR \fIstring\fR
User email address (required)
.SS keyorix rbac remove\-role
Remove a role from a user
.PP
Remove a role assignment from a user by email address.
.PP
With \-\-project, removes only the grant scoped to that project. With \-\-environment, removes only the grant scoped to that environment within the project (\-\-project must also be supplied).
.PP
Usage: \fBkeyorix rbac remove\-role [flags]\fR
