\fB\-\-description\fR \fIstring\fR
Description
.TP
\fB\-\-name\fR \fIstring\fR
Policy name (required)
.TP
\fB\-\-permission\-a\fR \fIstring\fR
First permission, e.g. roles.assign (required)
.TP
\fB\-\-permission\-b\fR \fIstring\fR
Second permission, e.g. secrets.delete (required)
.SS keyorix sod policy delete
Delete a separation\-of\-duties policy
.PP
Usage: \fBkeyorix sod policy delete [flags]\fR
.PP
Examples:
