.nf
keyorix sod policy delete \-\-id 2
.fi
.PP
Flags:
.TP
\fB\-\-id\fR \fIuint32\fR
Policy ID to delete (required)
.SS keyorix sod policy list
List separation\-of\-duties policies
.PP
Usage: \fBkeyorix sod policy list [flags]\fR
.PP
Examples:
.PP
.nf
keyorix sod policy list
.fi
.PP
Flags:
.TP
\fB\-o\fR, \fB\-\-output\fR \fIstring\fR
Output format: table, json or yaml (default table)
.SS keyorix sod violations
List principals that violate a separation\-of\-duties policy
