.nf
keyorix user update \-\-id 12 \-\-display\-name "Bob Jones"
.fi
.PP
Flags:
.TP
\fB\-\-active\fR \fIstring\fR
Active status: true or false
.TP
\fB\-\-display\-name\fR \fIstring\fR
New display name
.TP
\fB\-\-email\fR \fIstring\fR
New email
.TP
\fB\-\-id\fR \fIuint\fR
User ID (required)
.TP
\fB\-\-username\fR \fIstring\fR
New username
